_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 6, "bbox": [48.0, 184.6171875, 168.75, 196.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 6, "bbox": [48.0, 211.4765625, 541.5, 256.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 6, "bbox": [48.0, 272.9765625, 541.5, 300.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第五条 申请和报销步骤\n\n申请人先核对行程、住宿城市与限额，明确实际入住人员、入住晚数及费用明细。预计超标时，应事先向部门负责人取得书面批准；批准记录应能对应具体住宿事项。入住后整理发票、订单、支付材料及必要的批准记录，再提交报销申请。\n\n申请中应区分住宿费与早餐、交通、洗衣、迷你吧等附加项目。本文没有规定这些附加费用是否可报，不能仅因它们与房费在同一张订单", "rrf_score": 0.015625, "bm25_score": 2.204804, "vector_score": 0.509633}]}}
